note Independent L762 boundary probe; handwritten Omega assertions.
global SnapAf ulong 6
global SnapAb long 4
fn probe ok bool to void
check ok add get Checks 0 1
end
fn main to int
probe not afinit 0 1
probe not afinit 65 2500
probe not afinit 1 0
probe not afinit 1 2501
probe afinit 1 1
probe eq get Af 0 12
probe eq get Af 1 0
probe afglyph 32
probe eq get Af 3 0
probe eq get Af 4 1
probe afinit 64 2500
probe eq get Af 0 819
probe eq get Af 1 2047
for c ulong 95
probe afglyph uchar add c 32
probe le mul get Af 3 get Af 4 65536
probe le get Af 2 160
end
probe afglyph 63
for i ulong 6
put SnapAf i get Af i
end
for i ulong 4
put SnapAb i get Ab i
end
put Alpha 0 77
probe not afinit 0 2500
same = true
for i ulong 6
if ne get Af i get SnapAf i
same = false
end
end
for i ulong 4
if ne get Ab i get SnapAb i
same = false
end
end
if ne get Alpha 0 77
same = false
end
probe same
probe afglyph 0
probe afglyph 63
probe eq get Af 3 get SnapAf 3
probe afglyph 127
probe eq get Af 3 get SnapAf 3
probe afglyph 255
probe eq get Af 3 get SnapAf 3
if ne get Fails 0 0
ret 1
end
ret 0
end
